            </note>
            <note corresp="#d226-f2" n="55" xml:id="d226-f2-content">
                <p>Jacques A. Cuttat, Chief of the Western Section of the Division of Political
                    Affairs of the Swiss Ministry for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d226-f3" n="56" xml:id="d226-f3-content">
                <p>Morris N. Hughes, Counselor of Legation in Switzerland.</p>
            </note>
